Contains various tasks which require a wide variety of techniques in order to determine reachability.
Some make specific use of pointers, some of arrays, some of structs, some of floats, and some combine everything.
These examples are derived from the the dissertation "Applying software model checking: experiences and advancements" (https://doi.org/10.18154/RWTH-2024-10081).
